  "ruleText": "Env-Wq 902.06 “Counselor-in-training (CIT)” means an individual who works directly with campers only under the supervision of a counselor.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note #1 and Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Env-Wq 900) #12364, eff 9-1-17",
